<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill cuts Heinz.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill cuts Heinz.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it downgraded H.J. Heinz Co to intermediate-term accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>-- said kept the long-term rating as buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Heinze lost 1/4 to 46-1/2.</p>
</text>
